  "notes": "- In-app updates: when a newer version is released, an Update button appears next to Settings. One click downloads the update, checks its signature, saves your open tabs and restarts Querithm. Turn automatic checks off under Settings.\n- Result grid: more selection, sorting and copy options, and clearer header sort indicators.\n- Editor: expand `*` to the column list, and signature help while typing a procedure or function call.\n- Query errors switch to Messages & Stats automatically.\n- Connections: choose how long Querithm remembers a password (once, for this session, for a set time, or always).\n- Import: a small file that finished importing very quickly no longer leaves the wizard stuck on \"Cancel import\".",
